[C]Rescuing the soul that has [G]been shak[D]en
[Em]Fear the Lord you holy [Bm]ones
[Am7]Lacking nothing [D]under the sun
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[G]Young li[D/F#]ons grow [Em]poor and hungry
